1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,460
So here is the answer to our sal tree.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:04,348
There is no pump at the bottom.

3
00:00:04,348 --> 00:00:11,354
The pump is the sun at the top, and the rope is the water column itself, held together by cohesion.

4
00:00:11,354 --> 00:00:17,513
A suction pump fails at ten metres because all it can use is the push of the atmosphere from below.

